{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for an endless onslaught of the undead in Mortalis Meltdown, a heart-pounding, action-packed top-down zombie shooter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embrace the thrill of survival as you face wave after wave of relentless zombies, their numbers growing ever larger and their hunger for flesh never-ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mortalis Meltdown is the ultimate test of your zombie-slaying prowess. Can you survive the endless onslaught and emerge as the ultimate undead hunter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless waves of zombies that you need to outmaneuver</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain points for kills, compete against a leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple weapons that are upgradable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect health packs to stay alive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Difficulty increases as the game progresses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase additional characters to play as</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mortalis Meltdown is a work in progress. Stay put for more updates.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Survive 1 wave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2752790/6f3469cbcc0c9716ee6739130af71de37b39165e.jpg"},{"name":"Survive 3 waves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2752790/25eeaa283c72537fd593845003268e8b93459b65.jpg"},{"name":"Survive 5 waves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2752790/4aaa8de9e6289d388f6180d754226044204bf11c.jpg"},{"name":"100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2752790/385610196737440e6676a6ea38eb9e00ed881fc1.jpg"},{"name":"250","pat